  <div class="space-y-4">
   <details class="card p-5 group"><summary class="font-black text-slate-900 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-sm uppercase">¿Qué es una estacion 3-en-1?<span class="text-brandOrange group-open:rotate-180 transition">▼</span></summary><p class="faq-answer text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">Carga iPhone + Apple Watch + AirPods simultaneamente. Qi2 MPP con imanes N52H. 40-50% del ingreso de categoria - el formato de mayor margen con 50-150 EUR retail.</p></details>
   <details class="card p-5 group"><summary class="font-black text-slate-900 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-sm uppercase">MOQ para estaciones 3-en-1?<span class="text-brandOrange group-open:rotate-180 transition">▼</span></summary><p class="faq-answer text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">MOQ <strong>500 unidades</strong> ODM con logo. OEM: <strong>2.000</strong>. Muestras en 3-7 días.</p></details>
   <details class="card p-5 group"><summary class="font-black text-slate-900 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-sm uppercase">Diferencia entre 15W y 25W?<span class="text-brandOrange group-open:rotate-180 transition">▼</span></summary><p class="faq-answer text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">15W usa Qi2 MPP para iPhone 12-16. <strong>25W</strong> usa Qi v2.2.1 con refrigeracion activa para Pixel 10, Galaxy S25 y iPhone 16 25W. Los 25W incluyen ventilador o TEC.</p></details>
   <details class="card p-5 group"><summary class="font-black text-slate-900 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-sm uppercase">Adecuadas para hoteles?<span class="text-brandOrange group-open:rotate-180 transition">▼</span></summary><p class="faq-answer text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">Si. WOW90 (zinc), WOW18 (luz nocturna) y WOW83 (watch desmontable) para mesitas. Precios volumen desde 1.000 unidades.</p></details>
   <details class="card p-5 group"><summary class="font-black text-slate-900 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-sm uppercase">Plazos producción OEM/ODM?<span class="text-brandOrange group-open:rotate-180 transition">▼</span></summary><p class="faq-answer text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">OEM: <strong>25-30 días</strong>. ODM: <strong>45-60 días</strong>. Envío expres 5-7 días a España. DDP con aduana disponible.</p></details>
